---
title: "Pump run loop"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: off
    lg1: running
    lg2: lockout
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  s0: Pump off
  s1: Pump running
  s2: Pump running, short period
  s3: Pump running, period grew
  s4: Just stopped for no flow
  s5: One second since the stop
  s6: A new start was ignored
  s7: Two seconds since the stop
  s8: A new start was ignored, one second gone
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a plateau starts the pump
  s0 --> s2: a short plateau starts the pump
  s1 --> s0: emergency stop
  s1 --> s4: sensor data times out
  s2 --> s0: emergency stop
  s2 --> s3: a longer plateau arrives
  s2 --> s4: sensor data times out
  s3 --> s0: emergency stop
  s3 --> s4: sensor data times out
  s4 --> s5: a second passes
  s4 --> s6: a plateau arrives too soon
  s5 --> s7: a second passes
  s5 --> s8: a plateau arrives too soon
  s6 --> s5: a second passes
  s7 --> s1: a plateau starts the pump
  s8 --> s7: a second passes
  class s0 tan
  class s1 teal
  class s2 teal
  class s3 teal
  class s4 orange
  class s5 orange
  class s6 orange
  class s7 orange
  class s8 orange
